<section class="hero" style="padding-block:var(--space-2xl);" aria-labelledby="page-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <span class="eyebrow">About the Practice</span>
      <h1 id="page-heading">Built on a Simple Conviction</h1>
      <p class="hero-subhead">Patients who have lost teeth — or who face losing them — deserve thorough, honest, unhurried care. That conviction is why Foundation Dental Center exists.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-white" aria-labelledby="mission-heading">
  <div class="container content-split">
    <div class="fade-up">
      <span class="eyebrow">Our Mission</span>
      <h2 id="mission-heading">Advanced Care. One Patient at a Time.</h2>
      <span class="gold-rule"></span>
      <p>Foundation Dental Center is a focused practice. We don't see every dental condition — we see patients whose situation requires real expertise in implantology, bone reconstruction, and restorative dentistry.</p>
      <p>That focus allows {{ site.doctorName }} to go deep rather than broad. Every patient gets his full attention, from the initial consultation through final restoration.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fade-up">
      <div class="photo-placeholder" style="min-height:360px;">
