  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-light" aria-labelledby="values-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="fade-up text-center" style="max-width:640px;margin-inline:auto;">
      <span class="eyebrow">What We Stand For</span>
      <h2 id="values-heading" class="section-heading">The Foundation Behind the Name</h2>
      <span class="gold-rule" style="margin-inline:auto;"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid" style="margin-top:var(--space-xl);">
      <div class="card fade-up">
        <h3>Honesty in Planning</h3>
        <p>We won't tell you that you need something you don't. We also won't underplan and leave you with a result that fails.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card fade-up">
        <h3>Time With You</h3>
        <p>Complex cases require conversation. We don't rush consultations. You leave understanding your situation and your options.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card fade-up">
        <h3>Precision Over Speed</h3>
        <p>Good implant outcomes take planning. We use 3D imaging and precise surgical protocols because getting it right the first time is what matters.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card fade-up">
        <h3>Your Comfort</h3>
        <p>Sedation options, a calm environment, and a team that understands dental anxiety ensure the experience is as manageable as the outcome is lasting.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

